@startuml Discovery Component Diagram
title Discovery Stage - Component Architecture
skin rose
skinparam shadowing true

package "Discovery Module" {
  [catalog_client.py\nCatalogClient] as catalog
  [verifier.py\nVerifier] as verifier
  [suggest.py\nScorer] as scorer
  [validate.py\nValidator] as validator
  [mapping.py\nMapping] as mapping
  [registry.py\nRegistry] as registry
  [DiscoveryEngine] as engine
}

package "CLI Layer" {
  [discover.py\nCLI] as discover_cli
}

package "External Systems" {
  [catalog.data.gov\nCKAN API] as catalog_api
  [PostgreSQL\nJurisdiction Registry] as db
}

package "User Data" {
  [Local JSON\n(permits export)] as local_data
  [Discovery Dossier\n(output)] as dossier
}

' Dependencies
discover_cli --> engine : uses\n(pts discovery\ndiscover/register)
engine --> catalog : searches\nfor candidates
engine --> verifier : probes\nplatform type
engine --> scorer : ranks\ncandidates
engine --> validator : validates\nbefore register
engine --> mapping : guesses\nfield/status maps
engine --> registry : stores\njurisdictions
registry --> db : reads/writes
catalog_api --> db : data source
catalog_api --> local_data : --local-file\nfallback

legend right
  <b>Key Components:</b>
  - CatalogClient: Searches catalog.data.gov via CKAN API
  - Verifier: Probes URLs to detect platform (Socrata/CKAN/Other)
  - Scorer: Ranks candidates with weighted factors
  - Validator: Validates config before registration
  - Registry: Manages PostgreSQL jurisdiction storage
  - DiscoveryEngine: Orchestrates all discovery components
endlegend

@enduml
